<title>USA: FORECAST - API data week ending February 21.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - API data week ending February 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>(STOCKS IN THOUSAND/BBLS, CHANGES IN MLN/BBLS) REUTER SURVEY ESTIMATES*	   ACTUAL STOCKS FOR</p>
<p>FOR WEEK ENDED 02/21/97	    WEEK ENDED 02/14/97-CHANGE</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>CRUDE......... UP 1.60 million bbls    304,880	UP 3.122 MLN</p>
<p>DISTILLATE.... DN 2.00 million bbls    107,713	DN 2.897 MLN</p>
<p>GASOLINE...... UP 0.50 million bbls    206,289	DN 1.269 MLN</p>
<p>UTILIZATION... UP 0.50 pct pts     88.3 PCT     UP 0.70 PCT PT</p>
<p>*NB - The survey estimate is derived by omitting the high and the low forecast and averaging the rest.</p>
</text>
